{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function debounceStrategy(options): DebounceStrategy;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts#L28","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts:28"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a debounce strategy that delays transaction execution until after\na period of inactivity."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ideal for scenarios like search inputs or auto-save fields where you want\nto wait for the user to stop typing before persisting changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/DebounceStrategyOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DebounceStrategyOptions"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration for the debounce behavior"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/DebounceStrategy.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DebounceStrategy"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A debounce strategy instance"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const mutate = usePacedMutations({\n  onMutate: (value) => {\n    collection.update(id, draft => { draft.value = value })\n  },\n  mutationFn: async ({ transaction }) => {\n    await api.save(transaction.mutations)\n  },\n  strategy: debounceStrategy({ wait: 500 })\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction debounceStrategy(options): DebounceStrategy;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts#L28)\n\nCreates a debounce strategy that delays transaction execution until after\na period of inactivity.\n\nIdeal for scenarios like search inputs or auto-save fields where you want\nto wait for the user to stop typing before persisting changes.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`DebounceStrategyOptions`](../interfaces/DebounceStrategyOptions.md)\n\nConfiguration for the debounce behavior\n\n## Returns\n\n[`DebounceStrategy`](../interfaces/DebounceStrategy.md)\n\nA debounce strategy instance\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst mutate = usePacedMutations({\n  onMutate: (value) => {\n    collection.update(id, draft => { draft.value = value })\n  },\n  mutationFn: async ({ transaction }) => {\n    await api.save(transaction.mutations)\n  },\n  strategy: debounceStrategy({ wait: 500 })\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: debounceStrategy\ntitle: debounceStrategy\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction debounceStrategy(options): DebounceStrategy;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/strategies/debounceStrategy.ts#L28)\n\nCreates a debounce strategy that delays transaction execution until after\na period of inactivity.\n\nIdeal for scenarios like search inputs or auto-save fields where you want\nto wait for the user to stop typing before persisting changes.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n[`DebounceStrategyOptions`](../interfaces/DebounceStrategyOptions.md)\n\nConfiguration for the debounce behavior\n\n## Returns\n\n[`DebounceStrategy`](../interfaces/DebounceStrategy.md)\n\nA debounce strategy instance\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst mutate = usePacedMutations({\n  onMutate: (value) => {\n    collection.update(id, draft => { draft.value = value })\n  },\n  mutationFn: async ({ transaction }) => {\n    await api.save(transaction.mutations)\n  },\n  strategy: debounceStrategy({ wait: 500 })\n})\n```\n"}
